OL,3,GNEWSAMy journey from council estate to
OL,4,ADragons' Den
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You're leaving here to draw on garage
OL,7,Fdoors?" Nathan Murdoch recalls his
OL,8,Fformer chief executive quizzing him.
OL,10,FIt was the summer of 2018 and Murdoch,
OL,11,Fthen in his early 30s, had decided to
OL,12,Fleave behind a decade-long career as a
OL,13,Fhealth and safety manager to pursue
OL,14,Flife as a full-time artist.
OL,16,FHis boss's reaction "made me doubt
OL,17,Fmyself", he says. But eight years
OL,18,Flater, the 40-year-old from
OL,19,FPeterborough has built a successful
OL,20,Fstreet art business, painted murals
OL,21,Faround the world and, last week,
OL,22,Fappeared on Dragons' Den.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
